WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.100
Forward heavy starts the midscreen route.

2
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:03.250
Juri activates held Feng Shui Engine.

3
00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:05.350
Standing medium kick begins the ground chain.

4
00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:05.900
Crouching heavy launches Ryu into the air chain.

5
00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:06.900
Jumping light punch chains through jumping medium punch and medium kick.

6
00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:07.700
Medium Shikusen catches Ryu after the air chain.

7
00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:08.600
Repeated medium kick completes the dive follow-up.

8
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:08.950
Ryu lands well away from the midscreen starting position.
